    "description": "Mixed Lot Assorted Mineral Gemstone Specimens Rough Polished Stones\nThis lot includes assorted mineral and gemstone specimens featuring both rough and polished stones. Visible pieces include clear quartz geodes, tumbled stones in green, yellow, purple, and rose colors, a desert rose selenite, a pink rough stone, and a teal-blue mineral specimen. The stones vary in shape and size with natural, raw, and polished finishes. All items are in good used condition with no major chips or cracks. There are no brand or manufacturer markings.\nDetails\nThis is a pre-owned, donated item being sold “AS IS.\nItems may show wear consistent with usage and age, such as: discoloration; scratches; scuffs; dents; cracks; chips; holes; loose threads and stitches; edge and corner wear; box wear; oxidation; dirt; dust; other residue; owner-added markings; and signs of repair such as tape and glue.\nLot items may not contain all original parts or accessories and may have been outfitted with replacement pieces and/or modifications by previous owners\nBulk lots are not returnable. Due to the volume of items that flow through our eCommerce department, customer service requests to test items may be denied.\nAny certificates and markers of authenticity referenced in this listing are assertions of authenticity by the manufacturer, production company, or a third party, and not a guarantee of authenticity by Goodwill.\nItems and autographs without certificates or markers of authenticity cannot be guaranteed authentic -- while we do our best to identify and discard fakes, we are not experts.\nUnless noted, collectibles such as coins, comics, and trading cards are ungraded. Coin lots may or may not contain currency in circulation. Lots may also contain dead currency, reproductions, replicas, commemorative tokens, admission tokens, medals, and/or other non-monetary coins.\nAny items used for safety should be inspected by a professional before usage. All collectibles are intended f